{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2248","id":2191280849,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz886CnErR","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2248","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2248.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2248.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2248","number":2248,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"config: loosen up BaseDomain and ServerURL checks","user":{"login":"motiejus","id":107720,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzcyMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107720?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/motiejus","html_url":"https://github.com/motiejus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/motiejus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/motiejus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/motiejus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/motiejus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/motiejus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/motiejus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/motiejus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/motiejus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/motiejus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Requirements [here][1]:\r\n\r\n> OK:\r\n> server_url: headscale.com, base: clients.headscale.com\r\n> server_url: headscale.com, base: headscale.net\r\n>\r\n> Not OK:\r\n> server_url: server.headscale.com, base: headscale.com\r\n>\r\n> Essentially we have to prevent the possibility where the headscale\r\n> server has a URL which can also be assigned to a node.\r\n>\r\n> So for the Not OK scenario:\r\n>\r\n> if the server is: server.headscale.com, and a node joins with the name\r\n> server, it will be assigned server.headscale.com and that will break\r\n> the connection for nodes which will now try to connect to that node\r\n> instead of the headscale server.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/2210\r\n\r\n[1]: https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/2210#issuecomment-2488165187\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nHeadscale is \"Open Source, acknowledged contribution\", this means that any\r\ncontribution will have to be discussed with the Maintainers before being submitted.\r\n\r\nThis model has been chosen to reduce the risk of burnout by limiting the\r\nmaintenance overhead of reviewing and validating third-party code.\r\n\r\nHeadscale is open to code contributions for bug fixes without discussion.\r\n\r\nIf you find mistakes in the documentation, please submit a fix to the documentation.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<!-- Please tick if the following things apply. You… -->\r\n\r\n- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\r\n- [x] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [x] added unit tests\r\n- [ ] added integration tests\r\n- [ ] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [x] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n","created_at":"2024-11-21T04:38:57Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T08:46:08Z","closed_at":"2024-11-22T12:21:44Z","merged_at":"2024-11-22T12:21:44Z","merge_commit_sha":"c6336adb01894b1f20618f35dbbf74f4fb5f37d6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalb